Package: habforecastr
Type: Package
Title: Functions for Forecasting HAB Risk in Scotland
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Tim Szewczyk
Maintainer: Tim Szewczyk <tim.szewczyk@sams.ac.uk>
Description: Currently intended for internal use. This package contains all of
    the functions needed for data download and processing, model fitting, 
    generating predictions, and assessing performance. See Szewczyk et al. 2025 
    for details of original ensemble modelling system (DOI 10.1016/j.hal.2024.102781)
